       "main_head": "<h2>The work doesn\u2019t just slow you down. <strong><em>It hides</em> <em>what needs attention.</em></strong></h2>\n<p>The Monday reorder review. The reconciliation between your sales channels. The spreadsheet nobody else can rebuild. The supplier confirmation that triggers four downstream tasks. The follow-up with your supply chain operators.</p>\n<p>Flieber Studio builds agents that don\u2019t just automate the work. They detect risks, surface opportunities, and recommend what to do next, so your team can act before problems hit the numbers.</p>",
       "module_id": 215209921832,
       "schema_version": 2,
       "thick_text": "<p>Less busywork. Fewer missed signals. Faster action.</p>",
