            "studio_work_title": "<h3>A workflow that runs on schedule.</h3>"
           },
           {
            "blue_box_content": "<p>Monitor Gmail for supplier emails on open POs. If a delivery date changes, update Flieber and alert #operations. If it creates a new stockout, pause Google &amp; Meta campaigns and alert #marketing.</p>",
            "grey_box_content": "<p><strong><em>\u2192&nbsp;</em></strong> An always-on agent that watches your data and acts on rules you define.</p>",
